            "post_author_verified": false,
            "post_time": "2h ago",
            "post_text": "<p>I was skeptical at first, but the quality of the HOSFU device is impressive. The case is premium and the setup was a breeze. Already feeling more 'in control' after just 10 days. Highly recommend for anyone on the fence!</p>",
